      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Keeping the animator in the [`UIViewAnimatingState.active`](uiviewanimatingstate/active.md) state allows you to reverse the animation even after it has finished.",
      "normalizedSource": "Keeping the animator in the [`UIViewAnimatingState.active`](uiviewanimatingstate/active.md) state allows you to reverse the animation even after it has finished.",
