      "contextAfter": "When the value of this property is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), the animator automatically transitions to the [`UIViewAnimatingState.inactive`](uiviewanimatingstate/inactive.md) state when the animation finishes, thereby concluding the animation.",
