      "normalizedSource": "When the value of this property is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), the animator automatically transitions to the [`UIViewAnimatingState.inactive`](uiviewanimatingstate/inactive.md) state when the animation finishes, thereby concluding the animation.",
      "sourceHash": "5493d54cb0ff0ca00065499d31296b1b7227706eac05b4f6bacfadfa90452892",
